      "created_at": "2026-01-12T04:13:31.928Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In ERPNext POS, some customers with <strong>Unregistered</strong> type should not have tax applied, while customers with <strong>Registered Regular</strong> type should have tax applied.<br>\nHow can I set this up, since tax can also be set item-wise?</p>",
